  "notes": "{取|と}れる has multiple meanings: to come off, to be obtainable, or to be interpretable.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive) / potential of {取|と}る\n- Pair: {取|と}る (transitive, to take)\n\nMEANINGS:\n1. DETACHMENT: ボタンが{取|と}れた (button came off)\n2. OBTAINABLE: {予約|よやく}が{取|と}れた (got a reservation)\n3. HARVEST: {野菜|やさい}が{取|と}れる (vegetables can be harvested)\n4. INTERPRETATION: 〜とも{取|と}れる (can be interpreted as)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {汚|よご}れが{取|と}れない: stain won't come off\n- {疲|つか}れが{取|と}れた: fatigue was relieved\n- {休|やす}みが{取|と}れない: can't get time off\n\nHOMOPHONE:\n{撮|と}れる (to be able to photograph) uses different kanji.",
